      en: ["Valandovo sits at an elevation of approximately 80 to 100 meters above sea level.", "The Isar archaeological site near Marvinci contains remains dating back to the 4th century BC.", "The town hosts an annual 'Rakijada' festival dedicated to traditional brandy.", "The pomegranate is the official symbol of the Valandovo municipality.", "The Valandovo Folk Fest has been held annually since its inception in 1985.", "The region experiences more than 220 sunny days per year."],
      es: ["Habitantes: 4.000", "Altitud: 150 m", "Fuentes termales: 5", "Producción de fruta: 8.000 t anuales", "Asentamiento ilirio: siglo IV a. C.", "Festival de Valandovo desde 1960"],
